CORE
join_any1.sv

^file .* line [0-9]+: unexpected statement: fork$
^CONVERSION ERROR$
^EXIT=2$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
^warning: ignoring
^Invariant check failed$
--
An unnamed fork ... join_any parses successfully (this PR adds the grammar)
and then reaches the same "unexpected statement: fork" diagnostic as an
unnamed fork ... join, i.e., ID_fork is not yet handled beyond parsing.
This documents that join_any is accepted by the parser.
